{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55131","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 二十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军胜负，六害卦中凶。\n更作恶神幷恶将，直须固守候时（辛本、川本、京本作「晴」）风，惧（辛本、川本、京本作「俱」）慎莫前冲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}